#!/bin/sh
# Reads the host boot firmware (ПНС) flash partition table into
# /var/lib/reimu-pns/scan.json. The flash is shared with the host through a
# GPIO-controlled SPI switch, so this is only allowed while the host is off.

OUT=${REIMU_PNS_SCAN_OUT:-/var/lib/reimu-pns/scan.json}
PNSD=${REIMU_PNSD:-/usr/sbin/reimu-pnsd}
FLASHTOOL=${REIMU_PNS_FLASH:-/usr/sbin/reimu-pns-flash}

# With reimu-pns-flash (A/B image) the flash is switched to the BMC the way
# its reads and writes do it: the platform checked off under the lock that
# the power-on path honours (no power-on meanwhile), the switch restored on
# every exit, kill -9 included.
if [ -x "$FLASHTOOL" ]
then
    mkdir -p ${OUT%/*}
    if REIMU_PNSD=$PNSD $FLASHTOOL with-chip sh -c '$REIMU_PNSD --parse $PNS_DEV' > $OUT.tmp 2>$OUT.err &&
       grep -q '^{"ok":true' $OUT.tmp
    then
        mv $OUT.tmp $OUT
        rm -f $OUT.err
        echo "Флеш ПНС прочитан"
        exit 0
    fi
    # the reason: reimu-pns-flash's message, else the parser's JSON
    m=$(sed -n 's/^reimu-pns-flash: //p' $OUT.err | tail -1)
    [ -n "$m" ] && echo "$m" || cat $OUT.tmp $OUT.err
    rm -f $OUT.tmp $OUT.err
    exit 1
fi

. /libexec/gpio-funcs

state=$(busctl get-property xyz.openbmc_project.State.Host /xyz/openbmc_project/state/host0 \
        xyz.openbmc_project.State.Host CurrentHostState 2>/dev/null | cut -d'"' -f2)
case "$state" in
    *.Off) ;;
    "") echo "Не удалось определить состояние платформы"; exit 1 ;;
    *) echo "Платформа включена: флеш ПНС занят хостом. Выключите платформу и повторите."; exit 1 ;;
esac

spigpio=$(gpio2num $GPIO_SPI_CONNECT) || { echo "GPIO_SPI_CONNECT не задан для этой платы"; exit 1; }
# the flash back to the host whatever ends this
trap 'echo 0 > /sys/class/gpio/gpio$spigpio/value' EXIT
trap 'exit 1' INT TERM HUP
gpiowrite $spigpio 1
sleep 1

# the flash appears as /dev/mtd/sys only while it is attached to the BMC
mtd=$(readlink /dev/mtd/sys 2>/dev/null | sed 's#.*mtd\([0-9]*\)$#\1#')
rv=1
if [ -n "$mtd" ] && [ -e /dev/mtdblock$mtd ]
then
    mkdir -p ${OUT%/*}
    if $PNSD --parse /dev/mtdblock$mtd > $OUT.tmp
    then
        mv $OUT.tmp $OUT
        echo "Флеш ПНС прочитан"
        rv=0
    else
        cat $OUT.tmp
        rm -f $OUT.tmp
    fi
else
    echo "Флеш ПНС не найден (/dev/mtd/sys)"
fi

gpiowrite $spigpio 0
exit $rv
